{"id":"n13992-1-7","stage":2,"title":"식히다 · 冷却","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n13992-1-7-1","ko":"커피가 너무 뜨거워요.","zh":"咖啡太烫了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"커피가","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뜨거워요.","meaning":"烫，热","explanation":"뜨겁다：烫，热；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뜨겁다","audio":"/audio/e13d571ed55588aea4ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66027","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜨겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"是一种用咖啡豆制作出来的、苦涩的深棕色饮品，其含有独特的香味及咖啡因。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"e13d571ed55588ae","term":"뜨겁다","zh":"烫，热","audio":"/audio/e13d571ed55588aea4ab.mp3","entryId":"66027","definition":"某物的温度高。","pronunciation":["뜨겁따"]}],"audio":"/audio/30f80304af77a7706d04.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n13992-1-7-2","ko":"조금 식혀서 드릴게요.","zh":"我稍微凉一下再给您。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"조금","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식혀서","meaning":"冷却，凉","explanation":"식히다：冷却，凉；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"식히다","audio":"/audio/b1b82f5cd38ce38d17b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13992","senseId":"1","lemma":"식히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드릴게요.","meaning":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","explanation":"드리다：(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"b1b82f5cd38ce38d","term":"식히다","zh":"冷却，凉","audio":"/audio/b1b82f5cd38ce38d17b9.mp3","entryId":"13992","definition":"消除热气。","pronunciation":["시키다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"59252","definition":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3d30b8933a0c203065d4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.437,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=13992","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":61,"sequenceScore":1.2637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["咖啡太烫了。","我稍微凉一下再给您。","一到晚上就有点冷了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["咖啡太烫了。","我稍微凉一下再给您。","一到晚上就有点冷了。"],"answer":1}]}
